          "description": "Find every normative sentence of an ingested `library/` entry (folio-assistant-core's `l1-coverage` markers), flag uncertain readings, and propose the publication's identity. Given an agent's `l1-recommendation-curation/v1`, refuse a non-verbatim statement or an unknown location, and write the recommendations and remarks as an L1 3.0 graph (checked with `L1/schemas/validate.ts`) with coverage and proposed, unsigned exclusions.",
